info
# Issue #2917: loop() left slots of the wave unclaimed by the rework lane for
# ready priority:critical fresh issues. Info, not warning: this is the intended
# priority behavior, not a fault. The event exists so rework held back at the
# concurrency cap ("deferred by concurrency cap") is attributable to the
# critical issues it made room for, rather than reading as unexplained
# starvation (the silence that hid #2902 behind the rework queue).
